# Bible translation data: keep byte-exact and skip line-ending conversion.
# These are large generated data files, not source, so normalising them would
# churn ~141 MB of content on checkout for no benefit.
# NB: the pattern must be quoted — gitattributes splits on whitespace, so an
# unquoted path containing spaces is parsed as pattern + bogus attributes.
"Bible Translations Lookup/**" -text
